  "title": "Icarus: Re-Winged",
  "description": "Lots of new beautiful skins for wings!",
  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_bacc8ecc-1c0b-4f5d-802d-a641e4fd2213.gif\" alt=\"IcarusReWingedText\" width=\"535\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/r3ynex\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/kofi-support%20me-55c6f9?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=55c6f9\" alt=\"Support r3ynex on Ko-fi\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://dalink.to/polinatassel\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/artist-polina__tess-55c6f9?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Artist Polina Tess\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/icarus\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/required-icarus-e05d44?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Required Icarus Mod\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<h2 align=\"center\">An unofficial add-on for the <strong>Icarus</strong> mod that revamps wing visuals and introduces new custom <strong>animated</strong> wing skins.</h2>\n<h3 align=\"center\">- The mod also includes crafts for all kinds of wings, so you can craft them on survival! (Starting from version <strong>1.1.0</strong>)</h3>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_ff733f1b-a66f-4bdf-97b8-9edf24ed14d7.png\" alt=\"IcarusFeatheredPanel\" width=\"850\">\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_9e5ecd4d-6bba-45f9-9eb3-ccacf7621621.gif\" alt=\"Feathered Wings\" width=\"850\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_15319117-900e-45e7-a76d-f40e8612fc9a.png\" alt=\"IcarusMembranePanel\" width=\"850\">\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_aa25bc61-c30a-4f2c-afba-1273c9670abc.gif\" alt=\"Membrane Wings\" width=\"850\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1584283/description_d6657711-4c93-42c7-aebb-4ce61e5145c8.png\" alt=\"IcarusButterflyPanel\" width=\"850\">\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a6a845f6-82b4-4859-8ad6-42c0e4a22701.gif\" alt=\"Butterfly Wings\" width=\"850\">\n</p>\n",
